\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Core spacing measurements across all 9 HGBS regions. Left panel: Individual region measurements (blue = robust, N $\ge $ 25; orange = limited, N < 25) with weighted mean (red dashed), projection-corrected value (green dotted), and classical IM92 prediction (gray dash-dot). Right panel: Comparison with published literature values (green = literature). The HGBS regions cluster around $2.1\times W_{\rm  fil}$, while external measurements span a broader range ($1.25$--$2.7\times $), suggesting environment-dependent variation around a generally sub-Jeans scale.}}{8}{}\protected@file@percent }
